{
 "_readme": "TANK sessions: you own a tank at Cushing and decide weekly whether to run a cash-and-carry (buy spot, sell a later futures month). 'weekly' is filled by scripts/build-physical.py from real EIA data: the NYMEX WTI curve (contracts 1-4, EIA series RCLC1-RCLC4), the delivery month of each contract (CME expiry rule), and the real weekly EIA prints (Cushing and US commercial crude stocks, week ending the previous Friday). EIA publishes four contracts, so the curve shows four months.",
